&lt;h2 id="what-is-a-binary-tree"&gt;What is a Binary Tree?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A binary tree is a hierarchical data structure where every node has &lt;strong&gt;at most two children&lt;/strong&gt;: conventionally called the &lt;em&gt;left&lt;/em&gt; child and the &lt;em&gt;right&lt;/em&gt; child.&lt;/p&gt;
